    "name": "Nora & Magic that does not turn back time",
    "steam_appid": 3656260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/0d2f7f2f3d458f11d36fd64804c0ab18.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDon\u2019t use formal speech. Please.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That was the first thing she asked of me when I woke up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I couldn\u2019t remember anything\u2014not who she was, with her amber eyes, nor how I ended up here. Nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet, she told me to call her Nora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic story born from pure love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Single-route Visual Novel \u00d7 Turn-Based Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approximately 4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/6d1202936e2c820b28879ecc98ea3689.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p>The story unfolds through alternating visual novel and battle segments.<br>Fully voiced main characters.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/305b42f12f429eee9fe1c50ed7d4ade6.poster.webp?t=1751823952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/305b42f12f429eee9fe1c50ed7d4ade6.webp?t=1751823952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/eb7d4a03ae7bbb76d56566570e0a8c6c.avif?t=1751823952\" width=462 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/fe43ef04b63fd9005d79aff1b33ec90b.poster.webp?t=1751823952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/fe43ef04b63fd9005d79aff1b33ec90b.webp?t=1751823952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p>Engage in card-style turn-based battles using preconstructed decks.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/d274b0e1b543a1af00fce33829f83ff5.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/2f600b189c45baf7b43c5aea46afb5d0.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/3f9da008b823318c15f974dce7e16f40.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/f7db83c458353ae036bc4f6ae0ef7cdc.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/0cec39d7dabc7220d37c10d53eca069f.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/e5d0210968c3c074e6c9bf26f1503405.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/ff88a826ac234e0a559f361c15e5e74b.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keyboard &amp; Mouse</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Left Click \u2026 Confirm<br></li><li>Right Click \u2026 Cancel, Hide Text Window<br></li><li>Ctrl Key \u2026 Skip While Held<br></li><li>Alt+Enter ... Change Fullscreen/Window mode</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gamepad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A \u2026 Confirm<br></li><li>B \u2026 Cancel, Hide Text Window<br></li><li>L \u2026 Skip While Held<br></li><li>START \u2026 Select Side Buttons</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Let's Plays</h2>I welcome it! You're free to stream the entire game.",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/0d2f7f2f3d458f11d36fd64804c0ab18.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cDon\u2019t use formal speech. Please.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That was the first thing she asked of me when I woke up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I couldn\u2019t remember anything\u2014not who she was, with her amber eyes, nor how I ended up here. Nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet, she told me to call her Nora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic story born from pure love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Single-route Visual Novel \u00d7 Turn-Based Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: Approximately 4 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/6d1202936e2c820b28879ecc98ea3689.avif?t=1751823952\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p>The story unfolds through alternating visual novel and battle segments.<br>Fully voiced main characters.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/305b42f12f429eee9fe1c50ed7d4ade6.poster.webp?t=1751823952\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/305b42f12f429eee9fe1c50ed7d4ade6.webp?t=1751823952\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656260/extras/eb7d4a03ae7bbb76d56566570e